    "keepTogether": false,
    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Lead Software Engineer with 15 years of experience building web and mobile products with TypeScript, Next.js, Node.js, and AWS. Over the last four years I grew from engineer on the Moonbeam web app to leading a team of 7 across web apps for several clients, owning hiring, architecture, and production launches. Before that I led a team of 5 to 7 engineers at Hermes on logistics software that processes thousands of parcels a day. I like taking a feature from the first idea to release and staying hands-on in the code.</p>"
  },
