          },
          "description": "<ul><li><p>Led a team of 7 engineers on web apps for several clients. Grew the team from 3 to 7, ran hiring and task assignment, and took each product from zero to production launch.</p></li><li><p>Owned end-to-end delivery of an infrastructure-as-a-service web app for fintech clients: the Next.js and Mantine frontend, the backend, and the AWS infrastructure (Amplify, Lambda, CloudFront, WAF) defined with CDK.</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Drove all technical decisions for a new file storage web app, defining the frontend architecture and the integrations with the backend services that let customers upload and retrieve files.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
          "roles": []
        },
