          "hidden": false,
          "content": "<ul><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>Core Competencies:</strong> Technical Leadership, System Architecture, Full-Stack Development</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>AI Dev Tools &amp; Agents:</strong> Claude Code, Cursor, Agent Skills, MCP (Model Context Protocol)</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>Languages &amp; Runtimes:</strong> TypeScript, Node.js</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>Frameworks &amp; Libraries:</strong> React.js, Next.js, React Native, Nest.js, TanStack, tRPC, Electron</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>State Management:</strong> Jotai, Redux, React Context</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>UI &amp; Styling:</strong> TailwindCSS, Mantine, MaterialUI</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>Databases &amp; Messaging:</strong> MongoDB, RabbitMQ</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>Cloud &amp; DevOps:</strong> AWS (Amplify, Lambda, CloudFront, WAF, CDK), GitHub Actions, CI/CD</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>Static Analysis &amp; Linting:</strong> ESLint, Biome.js, Prettier, Oxlint, Oxfmt, Fallow</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\"><strong>Testing:</strong> Vitest, Jest, Playwright, Cypress, Unit &amp; E2E Testing</p></li></ul><p></p>"
        }
